{"id":"5869","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5869_main_altostratus-translucidus-nimbostratomutatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>高层云是浅灰或浅蓝色的云片或云层，呈条纹、纤维状或均匀，完全或部分覆盖天空。图中，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">灰色的云相当均匀</span>。云底抬升和变薄，使云的大部分呈半透明，并可显露出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">太阳的位置，就像透过毛玻璃看太阳，这表明它是透光云类</span>。此时，高层云通过雨层云的变薄和抬升发展而成，因此可被指定为雨层云转化高层云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，塔斯马尼亚州，霍巴特附近的里士满","latitude":"纬度: 42° 44' 2'' S","longitude":"经度: 147° 26' 24'' E","date":"21 August 2009 1212 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 7, CM= 1, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.5.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.5.1"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5869_syn_altostratus-translucidus-nimbostratomutatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>当地时间09:00的气压图显示出在澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚州南西南974 hPa的低压中心。塔斯马尼亚州西部上空的相关冷锋向照片拍摄地（红箭头标示）东移。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2009，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5869_upper_altostratus-translucidus-nimbostratomutatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>0000 UTC在澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚州霍巴特机场（WMO 94975）的探测显示出从地面至对流层顶的湿对流层。中间层尤其湿润，这与附近的冷锋有关。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4387_main_altostratus-translucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这片高层云的大部分区域足够薄，能够显露太阳的位置（透光变种）。其西侧150公里处存在一个锢囚锋，正沿着整体偏西气流向东移动。</p></div>","copyright":"© A. Viaut","location":"Paris, France","latitude":"纬度: 48° 51' 24'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 21' 8'' E","date":"16 May 1951 1525 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 1, CH= /","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}